From fd2e5a836ff8e54899880835677fda5d12ce16d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hamish B <hmblair@stanford.edu>
Date: Sat, 10 Jan 2026 20:32:59 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Only apply gres when using GPU partition

Previously, gres from project config was applied regardless of partition,
causing CPU jobs to unnecessarily request GPU resources.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
